OL,3,ANew Zealand PM Luxon says negotiation
OL,4,Aand compromise needed with no clear
OL,5,Awinner in election
OL,6,
OL,7,FVotes are being counted in New Zealand,
OL,8,Fwith incumbent PM Christopher Luxon's
OL,9,Fcentre-right National Party and Chris
OL,10,FHipkins' centre-left Labour Party
OL,11,Fcurrently neck-and-neck - see the
OL,12,Fpreliminary results
OL,14,FLuxon says his party will be the
OL,15,Flargest in Parliament but says the
OL,16,Fresults are "too close to call", while
OL,17,FHipkins tells supporters that the
OL,18,Fdirection of the vote is not yet clear.
OL,19,FBoth parties are calling for compromise
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
